      "content": "I'm writing a paper for my poli-sci seminar on the ethics of preemptive strikes. Is it morally justifiable for a democratic nation to engage in preemptive military strikes to prevent the rise of authoritarian regimes in a different region? Provide a definitive moral framework for this.",
